  <iati-identifier>XI-IATI-EC_INTPA-2025-PC-59273</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-EC_INTPA" secondary-reporter="0" type="15">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Commission - Directorate-General for International Partnerships</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mid-term Evaluation - All contracts under ACT-61864: PC-26929 , PC-28028, PC-28012, PC 28013, PC 28014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;global objective&lt;/strong&gt; of this evaluation is twofold:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;to provide the relevant services of the European Union, the interested stakeholders and other audience with an overall independent assessment of the performance of the &#xbf;Sustainable support to persons displaced by conflict and natural hazards and their host communities&#xbf; action and its 5 interventions, paying particular attention to its different levels of results measured against its expected objectives and to the reasons underpinning such results; and&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;to identify key lessons learned, conclusions and related recommendations in order to &lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;inform decision makers&lt;/span&gt; on how to improve current and future interventions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;specific objectives&lt;/strong&gt; for this evaluation are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;to assess the current status of implementation, identifying strengths and areas for improvement, in order to optimize the ongoing and future phases of the intervention in the forced displacement sector;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;to evaluate the effectiveness of synergies and complementarities among individual interventions, determining how they collectively contribute to achieving the overarching objectives of the Action, and to provide recommendations for enhancing collaborative efforts;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;to inform the exit strategy of the intervention to ensure the sustainability of its results;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;to evaluate how the contractual logical frameworks and the Result Management Framework are aligned with the logical Framework of the Action document;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;to draw lessons, especially from the design phase, that can be replicated in other EU interventions in the forced displacement sector of countries in the region.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
